        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We developed new engine oil products for passenger cars and commercial trucks in support of our customers in all the major regions of the world in which we operate, including engine oil technology designed for the latest passenger cars and heavy duty engine oil (HDEO) specification, best in class electric vehicle transmission fluid, more robust fuel additives, as well as technology-leading industrial fluids.",
