        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We developed new products for the service-fill sector to provide our customers with the latest additive technology available and continue to advance our market-leading and technology-leading battery electric vehicle transmission fluid which pushes the forefront of compatibility, gear protection, and efficiency.",
